                        "glosses": [
                            "A motorway in Italy (and some other countries)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbc09f92-29c5-4bef-b0a7-e9f36f7edc70",
                                "sense_id": "3c74fe8e-6278-3b9f-9aa4-57e42468a8a0",
                                "text": "Chief MacDonald also warned of another threat to free highways in the possible resurgence of the private toll road, for which the Italian autostrade were the current models."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e5a1afea-3999-4dbc-990e-0856e93f509e",
                                "sense_id": "3c74fe8e-6278-3b9f-9aa4-57e42468a8a0",
                                "text": "Tolls on Italian autostrade are quite steep, ranging from $15 to $20 for a three-hour stretch, but offering the fastest and most direct way to travel between cities."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "58c3f496-88ac-4fb6-a767-9eabf6a1a54a",
                                "sense_id": "3c74fe8e-6278-3b9f-9aa4-57e42468a8a0",
                                "text": "Italian autostrade are even more impressive than German autobahns because constructing a road in Italy is so much more challenging."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5713d98a-f53a-43a6-a268-390e622b6e93",
                                "sense_id": "3c74fe8e-6278-3b9f-9aa4-57e42468a8a0",
                                "text": "According to a 1933 AAA guide to motoring abroad, Americans were reassured that unlike US highways, the Italian autostrade were not crowded."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4bede996-15ce-4559-b13e-9e9aeea9efaa",
                                "sense_id": "3c74fe8e-6278-3b9f-9aa4-57e42468a8a0",
                                "text": "now, exactly one year after a honeymoon night on the Edinburgh roof, our union is being tested again, this time on the Italian autostrade leading from Rome."
                            }
                        ]
